Domain Entity Session
    documentation 'This entity represents the prescribed span of time when an education institution 
                  'is open, instruction is provided and students are under the direction and 
                  'guidance of teachers and/or education institution administration. A session may 
                  'be interrupted by one or more vacations.
    shared string IdentificationCode named SessionName
        documentation 'The identifier for the calendar for the academic session (e.g., 2010/11, 2011 
                      'Summer).
        is required
        is queryable field
    enumeration SchoolYear
        documentation 'The identifier for the school year.
        is part of identity
        is queryable field
    descriptor Term
        documentation 'The term for the Session during the school year.
        is part of identity
        is queryable field
    date BeginDate
        documentation 'Month, day, and year of the first day of the Session.
        is required
    date EndDate
        documentation 'Month, day and year of the last day of the Session.
        is required
    integer TotalInstructionalDays
        documentation 'The total number of instructional days in the school calendar.
        is required
        min value 0
    reference School
        documentation 'Relates the Session to the school.
        is part of identity
        is queryable field
    reference GradingPeriod
        documentation 'Grading periods associated with the calendar.
        is required collection
    reference AcademicWeek
        documentation 'The academic weeks associated with the school year.
        is optional collection